        <mxCell id="p7_029" vertex="1" parent="p7_026" value="R01 domain authority · R02 mode isolation · R03 deduplication · R04 current, scoped authorization&#10;R05 material genealogy · R06 energy accounting · R07 reproducibility · R08 environmental assurance&#10;R09 delayed/offline links · R10 serial/configuration traceability · R11 advisory AI and tool boundaries&#10;R12 recovery and tenant isolation · R13 real-world compensation · R14 qualified KPI provenance&#10;Before implementation: resolve owners, operating context, licensing, selected runtime, data access and model readiness.&#10;This architecture package is a planning baseline; independent engineering and operational acceptance remain required." style="text=1;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;spacing=0;fontFamily=DejaVu Sans;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#20364A;lineHeight=1.25;connectable=0;">
